  "applies_to": "AAON packaged units fitted with the AAON Touchscreen unit controller.",
  "summary": "The AAON Touchscreen Controller runs the unit sequence (cooling, heating, dehumidification, economizer, heat wheel, fans) and offers BACnet MS/TP or Modbus on its RS-485 port. The list has 116 AVs (sensor readings, outputs and writable setpoints) and 42 BVs (stage, mode and alarm status plus three writable network commands: occupancy, VAV daytime heat and emergency shutdown).",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": null,
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "The table has no separate object-name column; the description column is used as the object name.",
    "Access is from the Read/Write column. Binary states are shown from the Min/Max columns (False/True).",
    "AV 93 and AV 94 are both printed as Cooling Head Pressure 1 Spt; the table does not say which circuit AV 94 covers.",
    "The manual describes BACnet/Modbus protocol, baud, bits/parity/stop and address settings on the Network Config screen but prints no defaults."
  ],
  "source": {
    "title": "AAON Touchscreen Controller User's Manual - Tables 3-7 BACnet Points List",
