    "enable": "Occupied mode comes from the internal schedule, a normally open remote forced-occupied contact on DI1, or the BACnet Network Occupy point (BV 39). BV 41 Network Emergency Shutdown stops the unit; BV 40 VAV Daytime Heat is the only way to start VAV daytime heating.",
    "heartbeat": null,
    "remote_sensors": null,
    "setup": [
      "Menu > Setup > Next > Network Config: Protocol (BACnet or Modbus), baud rate, bits/parity/stop and unit address for RS-485 port 1."
    ],
    "gotchas": [
      "With the Unoccupied Mode setpoint OFF the unit stays off when unoccupied.",
      "Space temperature and humidity (AV 114, AV 115) are read-only; there is no BAS sensor input in this list."
    ]
